✅ Real Scenario-Based Jenkins Q&A (Production Level)

1. Pipeline failing only in Jenkins, but working locally

Cause: Environment mismatch (Java, path, permissions)
Fix:

Check env variables in Jenkins
Compare Java/Docker versions
Verify workspace paths




2. Git clone failing in pipeline

Cause: Wrong credentials / network issue
Fix:

Check credentialsId
Verify SSH key or PAT
Test manually: git clone from server




3. Jenkins job stuck in queue

Cause: No executor / node issue
Fix:

Check node status
Increase executors
Check label mismatch




4. Build fails after adding new plugin

Cause: Plugin conflict
Fix:

Check plugin compatibility
Rollback plugin
Restart Jenkins




5. Jenkins pipeline fails with permission denied (very common)

Example: docker.sock error
Fix:

Add user to docker group
chmod 666 /var/run/docker.sock (temporary)
Restart service




6. Build works but deploy fails

Cause: SSH or target server issue
Fix:

Check remote server connectivity
Validate SSH keys
Verify firewall rules




7. Artifact not found in next stage

Cause: Workspace cleanup / different node
Fix:

Use stash/unstash
Archive artifacts properly




8. Jenkins job automatically triggering multiple times

Cause: Wrong webhook configuration
Fix:

Check duplicate webhook entries
Disable polling if webhook enabled




9. Pipeline fails intermittently

Cause: Resource issue / race condition
Fix:

Add retry block
Check CPU/memory usage
Add logging




10. Jenkins disk space full (production critical)

Fix:

Clean old builds
Configure build retention (log rotation)
Clean workspace




11. Wrong branch getting deployed

Cause: Misconfigured pipeline
Fix:

Print branch using env.BRANCH_NAME
Validate Git config




12. Jenkins credentials not working

Cause: Wrong binding or ID
Fix:

Verify credentialsId
Use withCredentials properly




13. Jenkins job slow

Cause: Heavy build / no caching
Fix:

Optimize Docker layers
Use parallel stages




14. Pipeline fails in deploy stage only

Cause: Environment-specific config issue
Fix:

Check environment variables
Validate config files




15. Node goes offline during build

Cause: Resource or network issue
Fix:

Check agent logs
Restart agent
Increase memory




16. Cannot connect to agent

Cause: SSH failure
Fix:

Check SSH keys
Verify connectivity
Restart agent service




17. Jenkins service not starting

Fix:

Check logs: /var/log/jenkins/jenkins.log
Check port conflict
Verify Java version




18. Pipeline syntax error

Cause: Incorrect Jenkinsfile
Fix:

Validate with Pipeline Syntax tool
Check missing brackets




19. Deployment failed after successful build

Cause: Wrong deployment command
Fix:

Verify scripts
Add debug logs




20. Jenkins job failed due to timeout

Fix:

Increase timeout
Optimize build steps




